
### List all departments
GET http://localhost:5046/departments

###

### List all questions
GET http://localhost:5046/questions

###

### Get the active evaluation cycle
GET http://localhost:5046/evaluation-cycles/active

### Submit a rating 
POST http://localhost:5046/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evaluationCycleId": 1,
  "unitRatings": [
    {
      "unitId": 1,
      "favourableFeedback": "Great communication",
      "correctiveFeedback": "Could be faster",
      "answers": [ { "questionId": 1, "score": 4 }, { "questionId": 2, "score": 5 } ]
    },
    {
      "unitId": 2,
      "favourableFeedback": "Very organized",
      "correctiveFeedback": "Nothing to add",
      "answers": [ { "questionId": 1, "score": 5 }, { "questionId": 2, "score": 4 } ]
    }
  ]
}

### View all submissions
GET http://localhost:5046/submissions

### Get one department's detail, with per-unit completion status
GET http://localhost:5046/departments/1?evaluationCycleId=1
